# Student Grade Calculator

## Overview
A simple Python program designed to calculate and assign academic grades to students based on their numerical marks using conditional statements (if-elif-else).

## Grading Logic
* *90 - 100*: A+
* *80 - 89*: A
* *70 - 79*: B
* *60 - 69*: C
* *50 - 59*: D
* *Below 50*: F (Fail)
* *Out of bounds (<0 or >100)*: Invalid Marks

## Tools Used
* Python
* Jupyter Notebook (optional environment for execution)
